## SQ-EFX-07 | Caffeinated holds Phantom Bane; time since rest untouched, reset when it ends
> scoreboard objectives add rest minecraft.custom:minecraft.time_since_rest
sleep 3
> scoreboard players get qe rest
> effect give qe farmersrespite:caffeinated 30 0
sleep 2
> data get entity qe ActiveEffects
> scoreboard players get qe rest
sleep 31
> scoreboard players get qe rest
expect has the following entity data.*phantom_bane
look rest score: rises between the first two reads (not -24000), reads 0 (or a few ticks) right after the effect ends
> scoreboard objectives remove rest

